  "title": "nVent Launches SCHROFF 4U LHX Compact Air-to-Liquid Heat Exchanger for High- Density AI and GPU Cabinets",
  "summary": "New compact 4U liquid cooling solution delivers up to 7.5 kW of thermal management for 19-inch electronic cabinets supporting high-power electronics and AI infrastructure. LONDON--nVent Electric plc (NYSE: NVent) (“nVent”), a global leader in electrical connection and protection solutions, today announced the launch of the nVent SCHROFF 4U LHX, a compact air-to-liquid heat exchanger designed to deliver reliable, high-performance cooling for AI, GPU, and high-performance computing electronics housed in standard 19-inch enclosed cabinets.",
